urname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><name><surname>Daniel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamazaki</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Menaker</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Block</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Chronic jet-lag increases mortality in aged mice</article-title><source>Curr Biol</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>R914</fpage><lpage>916</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17084685</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b15-ehp0115-001357"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group><name><surname>Dunlap</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Loros</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>DeCoursey</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><source>Chronobiology&#x02014;Biological Timekeeping</source><publisher-loc>Sunderland, MA</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Sinauer Assoc. Inc</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="b16-ehp0115-001357"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Figueiro</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name><name><surname>Rea</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Bullough</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Does architectural lighting contribute to breast cancer?</article-title><source>J Carcinogenesis</source><volume>5</volume><fpage>20</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="b17-ehp0115-001357"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Filipski</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Delaunay</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>King</surname><given-names>VM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Claustrat</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Gre&#x02032;chez-Cassiau</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Effects of chronic jet lag on tumor progression in mice</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><volume>64</volume><fpage>7879</fpage><lpage>7885</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15520194</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18-ehp0115-001357"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Filipski</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Innominato</surname><given-names>PF</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>XM</given-names></name><name><surname>Iacobelli</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Xian</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Effects of light and food schedules on liver and tumor molecular clocks in mice</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><volume>97</volume><fpage>507</fpage><lpage>517</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15812076</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19-ehp0115-001357"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fu</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>The circadian clock: pacemaker and tumour suppressor</article-title><source>Nat Rev Cancer</source><volume>3</volume><fpage>350</fpage><lpage>361</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12724733</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20-ehp0115-001357"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fu</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Pelicano</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>P</given-names></n